id=rk3588_mali_global
name=RK3588 Native Mali Global Upgrade
version=0.4.4
versionCode=430
author=sw1313
description=Firmware-specific RK3588 g18 GPU/KMD/CSF upgrade. Root compatibility uses actual interfaces and local boot layout, without root version or official binary-hash whitelists. Firmware/ABI and per-device rollback guards remain. First binding uses the qualified Magisk adapter; other root boot backends are not included.
